HEOREM_v0.1.pdf`; TeX supplies the proof. Run `python3 verify_curved_ground.py` with SymPy, NumPy and SciPy to reproduce 40 exact checks and two separately typed full nonlinear numerical campaigns. The graph constructor is inherited unchanged. Candidate action, independent review pending, no experimental data, physical promotion 0.\n"
